import configuration.dl

to [show Studio file prompt] {integer:operation} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set instance to state's view's instance
    set editor to the website source editor in state
    set titles to ["New file", "Rename file", "Delete file?"]
    set the value of "Studio inspector" in instance to 0
    set the value of "Studio file prompt" in instance to 0
    set the value of "Studio filename entry" in instance to ((-1) if operation = 2, else 0)
    set the value of "Studio file operation" in instance to operation
    set the text of "File prompt title" in instance to (the item at operation in titles)
    set the text of "File path" in instance to (the string form of "" if operation = 0, else editor's document's filename)
    set the text of "File status" in instance to (editor's document's filename if operation = 2, else (the string form of ""))
    set state's studio files' deletion to (editor's document if operation = 2, else (0 as a pointer to UI source document))
    bind UI key 256 with modifiers 0 from (the control labeled "Studio" in instance) in instance activating (the control labeled "Cancel file operation" in instance)
    if operation < 2:
        set target to "New file" if operation = 0, else "Rename file"
        bind UI key 257 with modifiers 0 from (the control labeled "File path" in instance) in instance activating (the control labeled target in instance)
    reflow the UI document in (state's view)
    set label to "Cancel file operation" if operation = 2, else "File path"
    set layout to the UI layout labeled label in (state's view's layout)
    refresh UI focus in (state's view)
    set state's view's focus order to layout's order
    set state's view's keyboard focus to true
    refresh UI focus in (state's view)
    reveal UI layout (the UI layout labeled "File operation" in (state's view's layout)) in (state's view)
    animate UI view (state's view)

to [close the Studio file prompt in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set instance to state's view's instance
    set state's studio files' deletion to 0 as a pointer to UI source document
    set the value of "Studio file prompt" in instance to -1
    set the text of "File status" in instance to ""
    unbind UI key 256 with modifiers 0 from (the control labeled "Studio" in instance) in instance
    unbind UI key 257 with modifiers 0 from (the control labeled "File path" in instance) in instance

to [cancel the Studio file prompt in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    close the Studio file prompt in state
    reflow the UI document in (state's view)
    set editor to the website source editor in state
    restore UI source location (editor's current) in editor in (state's view)
    animate UI view (state's view)
